击150次，之前一直都能完成目标，可最近一直无法完成。[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_29"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"eventData":"{\r  \"para\": {\r    \"bubbles\": {\r      \"chara041_1\": \"03\"\r    }\r  },\r  \"action\": \"bubble\"\r}","event":"GAoEvent"},"key":"event"},{"para":{"text":"[show]我因此怀疑自己是否懈怠了，于是加大了训练量，可依旧没有任何成效。所以我想自己应该是进入瓶颈期了。[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"text":"[show]{myName}的实力远在我之上，所以我想问问你，是否有突破瓶颈的方法，我不想乖乖等着瓶颈期过去。[l]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1a","noIn":false,"x":276,"img":"chara041_1","scaleY":1,"bright":0.6,"layer":"chara2","y":-325,"mirrow":false},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"我一时还没有什么头绪……","tag":"tag_8"},{"text":"要不你说说给自己加练情况？","tag":"tag_8"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1a","noIn":false,"x":276,"img":"chara041_1","scaleY":1,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","y":-325,"mirrow":false},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"text":"[cm][show]是这样的……除去上班和睡觉的时间外，我基本都在训练，内容通常是负重跑、挥剑、举重等等。[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"text":"[show]当然，理论我也没有落下。每天晚上睡前，我都会花时间阅读剑术理论。所以我每天的睡觉时间大概只有五个小时左右。但即使是这样，我也依旧无法突破。[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"text":"[show]我知道我这样的训练强度在{myName}眼前不值一提，但身为治安队队长的我有许多工作，实在无法抽出多余的时间，希望你不要介意。[l]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1b","noIn":false,"x":276,"img":"chara041_1","scaleY":1,"bright":0.6,"layer":"chara2","y":-325,"mirrow":false},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"不不不，埃迪蒂的训练强度比我强多了。","tag":"tag_12"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_12"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1d","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1d","noIn":false,"x":276,"img":"chara041_1","scaleY":1,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","y":-325,"mirrow":false},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_30"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"eventData":"{\r  \"para\": {\r    \"bubbles\": {\r      \"chara041_1\": \"08\"\r    }\r  },\r  \"action\": \"bubble\"\r}","event":"GAoEvent"},"key":"event"},{"para":{"text":"[cm][show]是吗？可为什么我一直无法进步呢？[l]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_13"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1d","noIn":false,"x":276,"img":"chara041_1","scaleY":1,"bright":0.6,"layer":"chara2","y":-325,"mirrow":false},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"我想埃迪蒂的压力太大了。","tag":"tag_14"},{"text":"你可能需要休息一下。","tag":"tag_14"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_14"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1d","noIn":false,"x":276,"img":"chara041_1","scaleY":1,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","y":-325,"mirrow":false},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"text":"[cm][show]休息？可我身为治安队队长，休息就意味着懈怠。而且休息和突破瓶颈变强之间……有什么必然的联系吗？[l]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_15"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1d","noIn":false,"x":276,"img":"chara041_1","scaleY":1,"bright":0.6,"layer":"chara2","y":-325,"mirrow":false},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"卡在瓶颈的原因可能和实力无关。","tag":"tag_16"},{"text":"很有可能是埃迪蒂单纯太累的缘故。","tag":"tag_16"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_16"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1b","noIn":false,"x":276,"img":"chara041_1","scaleY":1,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","y":-325,"mirrow":false},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"text":"[cm][show]太累？这只是变强所需要付出的一些小代价罢了……而且我可是治安队队长，自然要承担超越常人的疲惫。[l]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_17"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1b","noIn":false,"x":276,"img":"chara041_1","scaleY":1,"bright":0.6,"layer":"chara2","y":-325,"mirrow":false},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"但埃迪蒂也是人！","tag":"tag_18"},{"text":"是人就需要休息！","tag":"tag_18"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_18"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"只有劳逸结合，才能真正提升实力。","tag":"tag_19"},{"text":"盲目训练只会让自己原地打滚！","tag":"tag_19"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_19"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1e","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1e","noIn":false,"x":276,"img":"chara041_1","scaleY":1,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","y":-325,"mirrow":false},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"text":"[cm][show]嗯……虽然还是不太明白，但毕竟是{myName}的建议，我相信你。只要能用合理的方法变强，我都可以接受。[l][cm]","charaNa